File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_MasonsGuild_SilverKey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_MasonsGuild_SilverKey\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a5ea7cd3-6599-40e5-b609-50056b65a361</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a5ea7cd3-6599-40e5-b609-50056b65a361\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a5ea7cd3-6599-40e5-b609-50056b65a361\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Obtained from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mattis\" title=\"Mattis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/25px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/38px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/50px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mattis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png/25px-Portrait_Mattis.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Mattis.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mattis\" title=\"Mattis\">Mattis</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a></li>\n<li>In a bag behind a counter in the Last Light Inn, if Mattis died in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Opens the <b>Keyholed Herald</b>, a locked device that reveals a secret area in the Reithwin <a href=\"/wiki/Mason%27s_Guild\" title=\"Mason's Guild\">Mason's Guild</a>. The Keyholed Herald is in the basement of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mason%27s_Guild\" title=\"Mason's Guild\">Mason's Guild</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;123&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-688</span> and requires a <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check to spot.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201947\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1559/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24346/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5504/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936035/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.349      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   41.349      1 -total\n 48.26%   19.954      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.11%   17.826     16 Template:Trim\n 22.95%    9.490      2 Template:Uid\n 15.40%    6.366      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.74%    6.096      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.54%    6.011      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.50%    5.582      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.58%    5.201      2 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9377-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201947 and revisio